7. She is grateful to her fans and feels deeply privileged, vowing never to take her success or their support for granted. (Verbatim: "i never ever want to take what I have for granted... I hope that like with my hard work I can really really demonstrate how much I appreciate it")
8. She once aspired to go into journalism but changed her mind after a negative school experience where she lost a competition despite putting in significant effort. (Verbatim: "there was a time i really want i thought i wanted to go into journalism... they picked her because she was the teacher's son's girlfriend")
